{"id":59222,"date":"2026-08-13T07:39:48","date_gmt":"2026-08-13T06:39:48","guid":{"rendered":""},"modified":"2026-09-03T00:37:15","modified_gmt":"2026-09-02T23:37:15","slug":"meia-maratona-guimaraes","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/meia-maratona-guimaraes\/","title":{"rendered":"Meia Maratona Cidade Ber\u00e7o 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Meia Maratona Cidade Ber\u00e7o 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Meia Maratona Cidade Ber\u00e7o 2026<\/strong> realiza-se na segunda-feira, <strong>5 de Outubro de 2026<\/strong> (feriado nacional da Implanta\u00e7\u00e3o da Rep\u00fablica), na hist\u00f3rica e monumental cidade de <strong>Guimar\u00e3es<\/strong>, no distrito de <strong>Braga<\/strong>. Organizada pela <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Guimar\u00e3es<\/strong> em colabora\u00e7\u00e3o com a <strong>Tempo Livre<\/strong> e a <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Braga<\/strong>, a prova celebra o desporto e o patrim\u00f3nio no ber\u00e7o da nacionalidade portuguesa.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida no emblem\u00e1tico <strong>Campo de S\u00e3o Mamede<\/strong> (aos p\u00e9s do Castelo de Guimar\u00e3es), o evento disponibiliza a prova rainha de <strong>Meia Maratona (21,097 km)<\/strong>, a <strong>Mini Maratona (10 km)<\/strong> e a <strong>Corrida de 5 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>10h00<\/strong>, a <strong>Caminhada Solid\u00e1ria de 5 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>10h10<\/strong> e a <strong>Run Kids<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>12h00<\/strong>. O tra\u00e7ado urbano e r\u00e1pido passa pelos pontos mais ic\u00f3nicos do centro hist\u00f3rico vimaranense, proporcionando aos atletas um kit de participante completo com t-shirt t\u00e9cnica e medalha finisher.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: